---
---

<section class="cwm-home-section">
  <div class="cwm-home-wrap cwm-split">
    <div>
      <p class="cwm-eyebrow">If you are not ready to book</p>
      <h2 class="cwm-h2">Where washes lose money.</h2>
      <p class="cwm-lead">
        A short operator guide: chemical over-dose, downtime, and the leaks most sites miss.
      </p>
      <div class="cwm-guide-box">
        <h3 style="font-family:var(--cwm-serif);font-size:22px;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:500">
          Hidden costs in a tunnel
        </h3>
        <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:1.1rem;color:#536057">
          <li>The chemical leak most operators miss</li>
          <li>Why downtime costs more than the repair invoice</li>
          <li>Fixes that show up in cost-per-car within weeks</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <form data-form="guide" class="cwm-form">
      <div>
        <label class="cwm-label" for="guide-name">Your name *</label>
        <input id="guide-name" class="cwm-input" name="name" type="text" required placeholder="Name" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <label class="cwm-label" for="guide-email">Email *</label>
        <input id="guide-email" class="cwm-input" name="email" type="email" required placeholder="you@wash.com" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <label class="cwm-label" for="guide-company">Wash name (optional)</label>
        <input id="guide-company" class="cwm-input" name="company" type="text" placeholder="Site name" />
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="cwm-btn-primary cwm-btn-lg">Send the guide</button>
      <p class="cwm-hero-note" style="color:var(--cwm-muted)">No blast list. Guide only.</p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
